"""Mutations of part 7e's actors (src/game/static_weapon.*, bike.*, fish.*) for ../mutfast.py with
the actors build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_7e.py --models DIR --build build_item.bat --check check_item.py

Each should make check_item.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Generated from the sources (a
comparison, a number, an operator or a statement per line), then pruned. Left out as equivalent
(112): NormalizeBy's / LengthOf's exact-1 and 1e-8-bit limits and their degenerate branches (x, z,
y sign tests reached only for zero components); < against <= where equality gives the same
result; unused arguments (Drive's speed, a seat index the static weapon's calls ignore); defaults
overwritten before use (initial chunk ids, a member set again by StartMission / ReadProperties);
RemainingSize > 0 against != 0; =default destructors and the creators' lambda returns; loop
bounds only past UB; the box loop's corner 8 (corner 0 again); the bike's handlebar axis' z with
body.y zeroed just before; a fish member's phase / rate defaults (set before use).
Ten more did not compile and were dropped.

Results (2026-10-27): the first run caught 797 of 966 (10 did not compile, 159 survived); of the
159, 112 equivalent (above) and 47 needed new cases (ten fish, the camera at 15.2 m, a still
update, short chunks, depths; the bike's ram / handlebar pitch, sound and rider set beforehand, a
narrow point and steering, loads without speed or count; the static weapon's sight turned about
two axes and one box turned so that corners 0 and 1 alone make the least x and z, a flat plate,
the gun's own vertices, the sight in the state fills, WriteProperties' result, occupants away
from the origin, the uses, a tiny exit y, containers / reliable / fromClient, the frame moved
before Update, corner sentinels, an empty box's UpdateVolume, a flat box). A full rerun caught 843:
the frame following the handlebars three times as fast under 3 degrees had been reached only by
chance in the random ride; a fixed case with the handlebars 2 degrees off. All 844 caught."""
